{
  "slug": "honeycomb",
  "name": "Honeycomb",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skills, agents, and workflows for Honeycomb observability — query patterns, production investigations, SLOs, OpenTelemetry instrumentation, and Beeline migration. Designed to complement the Honeycomb MCP server.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**, **2 agents**, **1 command**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `beeline-migration` (Step-by-step guide for migrating from Honeycomb Beelines (End of Life) to OpenTelemetry instrumentation), `create-honeycomb-board` (Design and then create a board (dashboard) in Honeycomb with queries and SLOs), `metrics-queries` (How to query OpenTelemetry metrics datasets in Honeycomb correctly), `observability-fundamentals` (First principles behind observability — wide events, high cardinality, the core analysis loop, events vs metrics vs logs,…), `otel-genai-instrumentation` (Guides instrumentation of GenAI/LLM applications with OpenTelemetry for Honeycomb, including content capture and agent failure detection), `otel-instrumentation` (Provides guidance on OpenTelemetry SDK setup, custom instrumentation, and sending data to Honeycomb), `otel-migration` (Guide for retrofitting OpenTelemetry into an existing, uninstrumented application), `production-investigation` (Structured workflows for investigating production issues in Honeycomb — the sequence of tool calls (context priming, broad query,…), and 3 more\n- **Agents** (2): `honeycomb-investigator` (Use this agent when the user needs an autonomous, multi-step investigation of a production issue using Honeycomb), `instrumentation-advisor` (Use this agent when the user wants to improve their application's observability by analyzing their codebase against what…)\n- **Commands** (1): `honeycomb-setup` (Set up the Honeycomb MCP server connection for Claude Code)\n- **Hooks** (2): `PostToolUse`, `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `honeycomb`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install honeycomb@claude-plugins-official` from `honeycombio/agent-skill` (`honeycomb`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
